            "level": {
              "value": 1
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You have plenty of practice navigating webs. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to saves and AC against the web spell, natural webbing, and effects that entrap you in webbing, as well as a +1 circumstance bonus against other effects that snare and entangle you, like the entangle spell. Whenever you roll a success on a saving throw against an effect involving a web, you get a critical success instead."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
